        "note": "Doc 47 unit CO.10: the wrecker, Occator's heavy recovery rig, so a player's tug can take in a raider's line tank (29.9 t laden, which no earlier leased rig reached: the 6 t prospector tows 12 t, the 8 t escort 16 t, the 7 t tender 21 t). The tender's chassis widened and ballasted: 12 t dry (provisional), unarmed, one teleoperated cab, a 1 t / 2 m3 stow.bulk tool locker and no tender stores. logistics.recovery_profile recovery_optimized tows three times its mass, 36 t laden (Q-41-27), so it takes any shipped line tank and refuses a heavier hull. 12 t and 36 m3 ride a Dray-P's 20 t / 70 m3 bay beside a prospector or an escort. Occator leases it beside the tender (+tv/lease wrecker).",
